---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import lab from "../../data/lab.json";
---
<Layout title="Data — Crawl Policy Index">
  <p class="kicker">Downloads</p>
  <h1>Data</h1>
  <p>
    Files are generated from warehouse views at export time. They are lab snapshots,
    not published series. Panel <code>{lab.panel_version}</code>, parse {lab.parse_version}.
  </p>
  <ul class="files">
    <li><a href="/data/lab.json"><code>lab.json</code></a> — full export used to build this site</li>
    <li><a href="/data/gptbot-named.csv"><code>gptbot-named.csv</code></a> — one row per named GPTBot interval</li>
    <li><a href="/data/gptbot-named-grouped.csv"><code>gptbot-named-grouped.csv</code></a> — amazon.* collapsed</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="source">
    Refresh on the fetch host with <code>python3 warehouse/export_lab.py</code>, then commit the
    written files so Vercel rebuilds from the same snapshot.
  </p>
</Layout>
